      &lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/f/2/ff2f7af460eb356043f9d8631d2bccbb8bdb3dce.png&quot; class=&quot;site-icon&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;BDB496&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; height=&quot;16&quot;&gt;

      &lt;a href=&quot;https://massgrave.dev/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;massgrave.dev&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/header&gt;

  &lt;article class=&quot;onebox-body&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;aspect-image&quot; style=&quot;--aspect-ratio:690/291;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/3X/1/d/1db9b22d3c461cf59d1b503b08361354637bf04f_2_690x291.jpeg&quot; class=&quot;thumbnail&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;4B3F50&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;291&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://massgrave.dev/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Microsoft Activation Scripts | MAS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;An open-source Windows and Office activator featuring HWID, Ohook, TSforge, and Online KMS activation methods, along with advanced troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;


  &lt;/article&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;onebox-metadata&quot;&gt;
    
    
  &lt;/div&gt;

  &lt;div style=&quot;clear: both&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TL;DR：&lt;/strong&gt; PowerShell里输入&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;lang-auto&quot;&gt;irm https://get.activated.win | iex
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我一般选择 KMS 激活方式，有效期为180天，会自动重新激活。也有的佬有选择：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;quote no-group&quot; data-username=&quot;randname&quot; data-post=&quot;3&quot; data-topic=&quot;2321523&quot; data-full=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;quote-controls&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;24&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/user_avatar/linux.do/randname/48/1031314_2.png&quot; class=&quot;avatar&quot;&gt; randname:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;windows 推荐 hwid，office 推荐 ohook，没啥理由用 kms 的&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;p&gt;之前用过一次但这次又找了好久才找到，所以想存档一下，希望能帮到大家。&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;11 个帖子 - 11 位参与者&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
